  "description": "Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B (revision c1899de2, thinking disabled) and Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct (revision 7ae55760) model definitions without a runtime: the pinned chat templates rendered in C# for system, user, assistant and tool messages with tool definitions and calls (tool calling experimental; multimodal input rejected), a parser for the templates' JSON tool-call format (whole or streamed), per-request chat options, and each checkpoint's identity and decoder shape (QwenChatCheckpoint, ModelProfile) with tokenizer verification through the owned tokenizer Starlings.Tokenizers. No ONNX Runtime dependency. To run the models in-process on ONNX Runtime GenAI, reference Starlings.Models.QwenChat.OnnxGenAI. Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
